      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Well anyway",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You may be saying about now",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "\"How in the world does that old fella eat all of that crazy stuff",
          "rhyme": "9f",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And not get sick to his stomach?\"",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Haha, well, don't worry about that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You see, whenever I make a pig of myself on the filet",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Or the pudding or something",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I mix up some herbs and",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I come up with a dandy glass of this",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Bicarbonate of fig leaf",
          "rhyme": "af",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "That'll set me free, I'll tell you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Ugh",
          "rhyme": "yg",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Edible wrappers may be in grocery stores as soon as months from now",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "You've heard of good to the last drop",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Well, your food could soon be good to the last bite",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Wow, that was loud",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Got to ya, huh?",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Here's an interesting note, artificial colors",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Yellows or Reds",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Let's focus on the red",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "In addition to FD&C Red Number 40, the FDA has approved certain food coloring additives, some are actually poison",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "If you aren't sure of the additives or colorings in the products you've purchased, leave it alone",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Poison",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Bad news",
          "rhyme": "uz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "That's right",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Thank you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Well, I think that about covers all of the natural foods out here",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Now then, I have to go take my dessert here",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "I have to go",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "I'm conducting a cooking class today",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Good health to you all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Uh, over this way",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Look out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Alright Pops, still feel like charging me for that meal?",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGHIJKLBMNKKOAAPQPRSKTTBFUAVW",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDDEFGFDHIBJFHHJAAKJKHDHAABEBADF"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "outro",
      "performer": ", , ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "One look at his featureless face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "One look was enough to ensure his safety",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "As years passed, he became even more bitter and angry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Burning with vengeance against the world",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Finally, amidst hidden scrolls, he found what he'd been seeking",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Then, clothed in a suit of invulnerable armor, and possessing the world's greatest secrets of science and magic, he returned to his homeland",
          "rhyme": "#d",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And there he has remained",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Scheming, dreaming, planning",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Plotting his mad campaign to conquer the entire world",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I can't believe it!",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Alright, right, right, don't make a big deal about it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I warned you DOOM, you've gone too far (Yeah!)",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Do it DOOM, get your machine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABBCDEFDCGGHI",
